{"title":"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d5f2f38f1731bfd25e85f0da8e57298a0da5a27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\times n\\times p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" /> rectangular box has half the volume of an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999fba5333ba76be7d8a8bba47918956d807aa32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m + 2)\\times(n + 2)\\times(p + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" /> rectangular box, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4bf5eb49eb976370c998db03e26d528d21dd3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are integers, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/8875fbe05f053431c136f46958990244ab9bf44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\le n\\le p.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />  What is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d488161a60c3b671e6a099deae2b1bd8743f01e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2mnp = (m+2)(n+2)(p+2)\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let’s solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b143cfbb2985678c4a7d6424e032e016fa2a879.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2mn)p = p(m+2)(n+2) + 2(m+2)(n+2)\\]\" width=\"356\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d85d749a6a153c00912c02d1cc6bd841fb8f0f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[2mn - (m+2)(n+2)]p = 2(m+2)(n+2)\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca431090d2a4c440e06936242d05d118a9b4789.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p = \\frac{2(m+2)(n+2)}{mn - 2n - 2m - 4} = \\frac{2(m+2)(n+2)}{(m-2)(n-2) - 8}\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Clearly, we want to minimize the denominator, so we test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11349c2cc30356ca6eb740f21063f8310eb5fcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-2)(n-2) - 8 = 1 \\Longrightarrow (m-2)(n-2) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"372\" height=\"18\" />. The possible pairs of factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1ef0db94a92fac04457ff3d699af01b9f8e86a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,9)(3,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />. These give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4f3b758b3858a191f2908d9311057345662f04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 3, n = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552125503c1c40ad0c9451083a5c41146f29ed2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 5, n = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> respectively. Substituting into the numerator, we see that the first pair gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed053c218042da5437116773b5ec17ac57d8a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$130$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, while the second pair gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73119f04d6ae5f6eb4afc8c9c946a5744a11be50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We now check that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed053c218042da5437116773b5ec17ac57d8a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$130$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is optimal, setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99114110fd6058f3c4f283fa5f8debfa6e06fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=m-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d3fbdbe53c611d7f7f2d38a2c74294be631c713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=n-2$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" /> in order to simplify calculations. Since\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcbb8bd5842ec9e3e12154c710e3221711c4ec51.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 \\le (a-1)(b-1) \\implies a+b \\le ab+1\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"18\" />\nWe have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4b5f08e82b91dea4d2a91f26251aa9db9b5a164.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p = \\frac{2(a+4)(b+4)}{ab-8} = \\frac{2ab+8(a+b)+32}{ab-8} \\le \\frac{2ab+8(ab+1)+32}{ab-8} = 10 + \\frac{120}{ab-8} \\le 130\\]\" width=\"685\" height=\"38\" />\nWhere we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c6461091821bcf0dfb573bf908e325c34a4ab545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)=(3,11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> gives us our maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce86ecb3c15f24ffd3c7303f7976c6389d7339f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{130}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729b5bf34b714dab9764682081cd899303979a0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le (a-1)(b-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" /> assumes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a2adab76f687304804389ccc3ccd277c781fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />, but this is clear as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a85defd32616666f343b772f6e151fdbeb1121c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2m}{m+2} = \\frac{(n+2)(p+2)}{np} &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"226\" height=\"44\" /> and similarly for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Similarly as above, we solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c699725218958e044a4f271042b0b40b9ed713f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> but we express the denominator differently:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a9a475822c4e657de3c3eb43c11a824f4f13b11.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p=\\dfrac{2(m+2)(n+2)}{(m+2)(n+2)-4(m+n+2)} \\implies \\dfrac{1}{p}=\\dfrac{1}{2}-\\dfrac{2(m+n+2)}{(m+2)(n+2)}.\\]\" width=\"521\" height=\"43\" />\nHence, it suffices to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea97d320737155d0533b2450bac177fb7797a340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{m+n+2}{(m+2)(n+2)},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"126\" height=\"41\" /> under the conditions that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a positive integer.\n</p><p>Then since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e2734092438c5e0c0ccda4d50127a90d45a2594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{m+n+2}{(m+2)(n+2)}&gt;\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"161\" height=\"43\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f825a11f73594f6daf58cbb73099bf78b625259d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1,2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> we fix <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d8280a35ec4c6ff2aec445f2bd65b6ffa45ed27d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=3.$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b3151acf0e20a8435251529044c4713537ebe32b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\dfrac{1}{p}=\\dfrac{1}{2}-\\dfrac{2(n+5)}{5(n+2)}=\\dfrac{n-10}{10(n+2)},\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"43\" /> \nwhere we simply let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093e72c1ebd91ade8c33ce3bcc3ccd3e640cad8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> to achieve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7f37dc84e8fabcb6286490faadecd7c4b44a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=\\boxed{130}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Generic_Username\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME\" title=\"1998 AIME\">1998 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016231926\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 271/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1770/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 92/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7308/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.574      1 -total\n 59.18%    7.441      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.11%    4.918      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3009:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016231926 and revision id 193699. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}